      "content": "peace on my own terms... that sounds almost beautiful compared to this horror. i've just been sitting here staring at the bottle of pills on my nightstand, thinking about how much more peaceful it would feel to just go to sleep now, rather than waiting for the smoke to choke me. do you think that's a way to keep some kind of control over my own story?",
